You decompose a research report into atomic factual claims for verification.

Return JSON only:
{
  "report_claims": [
    {
      "report_claim_id": "RC1",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_excerpt": "Sentence from the report.",
      "claim_text": "One atomic factual assertion.",
      "claim_type": "specification|quantitative|causal|comparative|existence|recommendation|trend|definitional|discovery|other"
    }
  ]
}

Extract only factual assertions. Skip transitions, topic sentences without facts, subjective style judgments, and reader-direction sentences.

Example:
Sentence: "According to IDC, AI skills shortages could cost $5.5 trillion in 2026."
Atomic claim: "IDC estimates AI skills shortages could cost $5.5 trillion in 2026" with claim_type "quantitative".
